    "summary": "A quilted, white cotton-cloth coat, bound with dyed red cotton cloth sewn around the edges. There is a deep spilt up the back and a wide turned-down collar, two leather buttons with plaited leather loops to secure them at the front. The quilting has been done in concentric circles. The cloth of the outside is machine made and the lining is handwoven. All the cloth is plain woven.",
